        {
          "id": "intro-text",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "在浏览器和 Node.js 等 JavaScript 运行环境中，异步编程是处理 I/O 密集型任务的核心。传统的异步依赖回调函数，导致了“回调地狱”。ES6 引入的 Promise 改变了这一困境。"
        },
        {
          "id": "concept",
          "component": "ConceptCard",
          "title": "Promise",
          "tags": ["JavaScript", "Async", "ES6"],
          "definition": "<b>Promise</b> 对象代表了异步操作的最终完成（或失败）及其结果值。它有三种状态：<code>pending</code> (进行中)、<code>fulfilled</code> (已成功) 和 <code>rejected</code> (已失败)。状态一旦改变，就不会再变。",
          "example": "<pre><code>const promise = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    resolve('Success!');\n  }, 1000);\n});\n\npromise.then((value) => {\n  console.log(value); // \"Success!\"\n});</code></pre>",
          "relatedConcepts": ["async / await", "Event Loop", "Microtask Queue"]
        },
        {
          "id": "sandbox",
          "component": "InteractiveSandbox",
          "title": "动手尝试 Promise.all",
          "description": "你可以运行下面的代码，看看 <code>Promise.all</code> 是如何等待所有 Promise 并行完成的。",
          "language": "javascript",
          "code": "const p1 = Promise.resolve(3);\nconst p2 = 1337;\nconst p3 = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n  setTimeout(resolve, 100, 'foo');\n});\n\nPromise.all([p1, p2, p3]).then(values => {\n  console.log(values); \n});",
          "status": "success",
          "output": "[ 3, 1337, 'foo' ]",
          "onRunCode": { "name": "run_sandbox_code", "context": {} },
          "onStatusChange": { "name": "sandbox_status_change", "context": {} }
        },
